WEBVTT

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.660
Summer is half over.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:19.660
Hibiki remains boyfriend-less.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:23.410
I did my back yesterday,
so I'll work on my chest today.

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:26.040
I'll start with the bench press.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:31.450
Stay aware of your surroundings
when doing dynamic stretches.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:33.330
Oh, it's Akemi.

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:37.500
'Sup! Whatcha standin' here for?

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:38.500
Hmm?

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.080
What's with this huge crowd?!

00:02:14.950 --> 00:02:19.450
"Episode 4
'Did You Have a Nice Summer?'"

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.200
Gyms have "peak hours."

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:31.500
"Busiest Periods
(a.k.a. Peak Hours)"
Normal peak hours look like this.

00:02:31.500 --> 00:02:33.910
But it's summer vacation!

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:36.450
That changes everything.

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:40.620
One person decides to get
in shape over the summer,

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:45.120
another seeks the coolness
of an air-conditioned gym,

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:49.620
and yet another longs
for summer romance.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:55.330
This means both regulars and people who
don't normally go to the gym all come

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:59.290
at the same convenient time to exercise.

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:00.870
This period is called prime time.

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:03.910
"Prime Time"
This period is called prime time.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:05.410
So that's the situation.

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:08.450
We're smack in the middle of prime time.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.620
Ah, so it's prime time...

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.910
But this is quite the problem.

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:17.250
There's a line for the
bench presses and dumbbells,

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:20.120
and all the stationary bikes
and treadmills are in use,

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:22.250
so we can't do any aerobic exercise.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.580
Hmm, not much we can do.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:28.700
Everyone's eager to use the benches,
dumbbells, and cardio equipment.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.830
They're popular with
newbies and experts alike.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:35.040
And the power racks are full of regulars.

00:03:37.660 --> 00:03:41.040
It'd be nice if they all stayed motivated...

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:45.540
...but most of these people will stop
coming as soon as summer's over.

00:03:45.540 --> 00:03:48.370
Has this happened to you before?

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.790
I wanted to work on my chest today, too...

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:53.750
Ditto. But with things how they are...

00:03:53.750 --> 00:03:56.700
No need to give up, you two!

00:03:57.700 --> 00:04:00.540
Try using the chest machine today!

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:04.370
Huh? These look like bench presses.

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:07.290
Yes, they're the machine version of them.

00:04:07.290 --> 00:04:09.910
I've never used one of these.

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:13.330
Really? A muscle maniac like you hasn't?

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:14.950
Of course I haven't!

00:04:14.950 --> 00:04:19.250
Dignified chest training should
be done with free weights!

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.120
Machines are heresy!

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.540
I-Is that so?

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:27.790
A lot of people share her opinion.

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:31.790
True, free weights do offer more
muscle stimulation than machines.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:36.500
But machines have a charm
that free weights lack!

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.750
Charm?

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:41.540
Yes! Free weights are your foundation,
and machines are your supports.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:44.830
If you want results, using each
for its intended purpose is a must!

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:46.540
It's a must!

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:49.200
Must...

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:50.450
Mus...

00:04:52.870 --> 00:04:54.000
Muscular!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.830
They're huge! So huge!

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:59.790
Machio-<i>san</i>, you don't need to
follow up everything with a pose.

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.500
♪ Machio's Muscle Lessons. ♪

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.790
"Trainer Machio's
Strength Training Lessons"
♪ Machio's Muscle Lessons. ♪

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:09.330
"How to Use a Chest Press Machine"
"Trainer: Machio Naruzo"
On that note, I'll explain
the appeal of the chest machine!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.330
Its proper name is
the chest press machine.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:17.330
Even if you haven't joined a gym,
you may be able to try one as a visitor!

00:05:17.330 --> 00:05:23.370
While bench presses work out your chest,
you use other muscles while doing them.

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:24.370
Consequently, they put pressure on the areas

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:26.250
"Pectoralis Major Muscle"
Consequently, they put pressure on the areas

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:27.120
"Pectoralis Major Muscle"
"Deltoid Muscle"
Consequently, they put pressure on the areas

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:28.500
"Pectoralis Major Muscle"
"Deltoid Muscle"
"Triceps Brachii Muscle"
Consequently, they put pressure on the areas

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.700
"Pectoralis Major Muscle"
"Deltoid Muscle"
"Triceps Brachii Muscle"
around the shoulders and upper arms.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:37.250
In contrast, a chest machine's fixed path
eliminates the need to keep your balance.

00:05:37.250 --> 00:05:43.870
That means it puts far less pressure on
your shoulders and arms in comparison.

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:47.200
The machine also applies direct pressure

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:52.000
to your chest muscles more effectively.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:58.830
Use free weights and machines to meet
your needs, and make the most of your workout!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.450
Nice job, keep it up!

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:05.250
It's doing your chest muscles good!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.700
Great! Beautiful form!

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:10.870
Just a bit more!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:12.910
It's working, it's working!

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.910
Like you've stacked boxes on your chest!

00:06:16.080 --> 00:06:17.200
Right, okay!

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:20.200
Whoa, it's true!

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.370
This feels different from the bench press!

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.000
It's only stimulating our chest muscles.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:30.250
Right? It's important to change
things up once in a while.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.660
The chest machine...

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:36.290
Such sublime exercise.

00:06:36.290 --> 00:06:38.750
Didn't you think it was heresy?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.830
The chest machines are rarely ever
as crowded as the bench presses.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.540
Everybody loves the bench press.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.080
Double biceps!

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:50.540
The bench presses are full,
but the chest machines are empty...

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:51.700
"Dead Zone..."
The bench presses are full,
but the chest machines are empty...

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:53.700
"Dead Zone..."
This happens all the time.

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:56.500
When the bench is a no,
give the machine a go!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:00.330
Don't limit yourself to free weights.
Show the machines some love!

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.910
Side triceps!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:06.080
Can you explain anything without posing?!

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:10.500
Oh! Fewer people are using them now!

00:07:10.500 --> 00:07:12.870
Prime time is over, then.

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:15.160
Now we can use the free weights, too.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.120
Then why don't you do
some dumbbell presses next?

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:19.330
Right!

00:07:19.330 --> 00:07:20.870
Oh, there you are!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.750
Yo! Seems like you're in a good mood.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:25.790
Oh, my!

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:29.370
Ayaka! What are you doing here?

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.410
Well, about that...

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.950
Did you lose your dojo?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.790
"We don't do
martial arts."
Wrong era.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:40.500
"Glory Gym"
Our gym's gained a lot of students,
and it's gotten pretty cramped.

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:45.950
So I decided to offer additional
boxing classes here at Silverman Gym.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:48.870
Ah, so you're the one from Glory Gym!

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:50.250
I've heard about you.

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.950
Wow, it's like you're
opening a gym in a gym!

00:07:53.950 --> 00:07:58.000
Which means I'm going to
become a member while I'm here.

00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.250
--Hope you don't mind.
--How wonderful!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:02.160
So you're joining, too!

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:04.000
Then this'll be double the fun!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:07.250
--By the way, that trainer is super hot!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:07.830
--Macho, macho...
--By the way, that trainer is super hot!

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.370
--Macho, macho...
--He's got that modern Prince Charming vibe.

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:11.830
--Trust me, don't delude yourself.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:13.330
--Macho...
--Trust me, don't delude yourself.

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:16.120
Hibiki, you needn't go that far...

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:18.080
Huh? What does that mean?

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:19.330
--Well, you'll have to see it for yourself.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:21.750
--Yet another one of my students is here!
--Well, you'll have to see it for yourself.

00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:36.450
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.660
Yo! Shall we go, then?

00:08:39.660 --> 00:08:42.830
This is the first time we've
all gone to the gym together!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:44.660
Let's all get macho together!

00:08:44.660 --> 00:08:46.620
I'm not trying to become macho, though...

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.830
Today, I'm gonna use the bench press!

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:51.040
Oh, that'll be nice! And you, Hibiki?

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.870
Dumbbell flyes for me!

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.120
"Closed"

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.870
"We are closed today.
We apologize for the inconvenience
and appreciate your understanding.
Regular hours will resume tomorrow."

00:09:02.120 --> 00:09:03.620
"City Pool"
"Closed"

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.120
"City Gym"
"Closed"

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.120
What bad luck...

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:11.830
The local pool, gym, and training
facilities are all closed today...

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.910
I guess these things just happen.

00:09:13.910 --> 00:09:16.410
This really isn't our day.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.700
What should we do?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.040
I'd hate to just go home.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:21.540
Should we hang out somewhere?

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:24.750
Oh! In that case,
why not come to my house?

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:25.870
Huh?

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:36.330
Akemi... You live in a mansion
straight out of a manga.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.870
You think so?

00:09:37.870 --> 00:09:42.410
I've lived here since birth,
so I've never noticed.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:45.120
Spoken like a true princess...

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:52.160
My parents retired early and are
currently traveling around the world.

00:09:52.160 --> 00:09:55.500
Only my sister and I live here right now.

00:09:57.120 --> 00:10:00.040
Just the two of you in this huge house...

00:10:00.040 --> 00:10:03.500
Your sister likes working out, too, right?

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:07.540
Couldn't you make your own personal
training room with this much space?

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:12.750
A home gym, yes? I can't say I disagree,
but my sister and I believe that

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.950
if you want to work out,
you should hit the gym.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:20.500
Not every film lover prefers a home
theater over the real thing, after all.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:21.950
Th-That's true...

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:24.120
What a perfect allegory.

00:10:24.120 --> 00:10:27.450
That aside, I wonder what
we should do today.

00:10:27.450 --> 00:10:31.700
You can't do much more than push-ups
and squats at home, can you?

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:33.410
And stuff like dragon flags.

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:35.370
I told you, I can't do those!

00:10:35.370 --> 00:10:37.000
Oh, I know!

00:10:37.870 --> 00:10:39.120
Just wait there!

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.700
I found it! I finally found it!

00:10:46.700 --> 00:10:51.290
This is from my sister's personal library.
I think it has some useful information.

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:52.040
"<i>Read With Your Muscles!</i>
<i>A Dictionary of Exercises by Body Region</i>"
"By Toshio Ozu"

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.580
"<i>Read With Your Muscles!</i>
<i>A Dictionary of Exercises by Body Region</i>"
"By Toshio Ozu"
Seems like pretty serious stuff...

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.080
What's it say?

00:10:56.080 --> 00:11:01.950
"This book targets all exercise levels,
from beginner to pro." Huh...

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.160
"Toshio Ozu"
Hey, this is a creepy author photo!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:06.160
"Toshio Ozu"
Just who is Toshio Ozu?!

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:10.120
His book is popular even among trainers!

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:11.250
Let me put this in.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:20.330
"Read With Your Muscles!
Exercises by Body Region"
"By Toshio Ozu"

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:33.660
I'm Toshio Ozu, associate professor of
English Literature in the Literature Department

00:11:33.660 --> 00:11:35.450
at Koyo Women's University.

00:11:35.450 --> 00:11:37.620
"~Toshio Ozu (42)~"
at Koyo Women's University.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:41.000
"~Toshio Ozu (42)~"
Now, some of you don't live near a gym,
or may have days when you'd rather not go.

00:11:41.000 --> 00:11:46.700
Now, some of you don't live near a gym,
or may have days when you'd rather not go.

00:11:46.700 --> 00:11:51.160
For the sake of such readers,
I will introduce simple exercises you

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:53.000
can do in the comfort of your own home!

00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.750
"~Exercises You Can Do at Home~"

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.830
That's it! That's what we're lookin' for!

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.580
Y-You're a genius, Toshio Ozu!

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.250
What's up with that pose?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:07.500
"Read With Your Muscles!"
"Push-Ups" "Sit-Ups" "Squats" "Narrow Push-Ups"

00:12:07.500 --> 00:12:08.700
"Narrow Push-Ups"

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.000
"Narrow Push-Ups"
Hmm, so it's mainly push-ups and stuff.

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.000
"Sit-Ups"
Hmm, so it's mainly push-ups and stuff.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.000
"Squats"
Hmm, so it's mainly push-ups and stuff.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:17.830
I guess you're limited in what
you can do without a gym.

00:12:17.830 --> 00:12:21.540
Isn't there anything besides
push-ups, sit-ups, and squats?

00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:23.910
Ah! What about this?

00:12:23.910 --> 00:12:28.410
"~Dips~"
This exercise is called a dip.

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:35.000
Line up two chairs of equal height like so,
then stand between them.

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:38.870
Suspend yourself in the air.

00:12:38.870 --> 00:12:44.080
Now make sure to bend forward slightly.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.660
Where'd they all come from?!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.330
Wait, doesn't one of them look familiar?

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:54.790
Bend your elbows,
and slowly lower your body.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:57.370
This is called a "negative" movement.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.540
Aim for ten dips!

00:13:06.410 --> 00:13:08.410
They started doing it in sync!

00:13:08.410 --> 00:13:11.450
This is kinda... surreal.

00:13:12.540 --> 00:13:16.750
Avoid relying on momentum.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:22.790
Swinging ruins your sense of stability,
and decreases resistance by half.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:32.620
If you can't do regular dips, then try
doing them with your feet on the floor.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:37.660
This is called a reverse push-up.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:41.500
The negative movement
is especially important.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:47.830
Focus on lowering your body as slowly
as possible without easing up.

00:13:47.830 --> 00:13:52.160
Dips can work out your chest and triceps.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:55.330
Do bench presses and
dumbbell presses at the gym,

00:13:55.330 --> 00:14:01.540
then combine them with
push-ups and such at home, yes?

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.330
Yes...

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:07.870
Don't forget to work out your
mind as well as your body!

00:14:07.870 --> 00:14:13.870
Strive to become a total fighter who
possesses both brains and brawn!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.620
"Planning and Production
by Toshio Ozu"

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:20.200
I can't stomach any more of this.

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.410
What a wonderful video!

00:14:22.410 --> 00:14:24.290
Let's try that right away!

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:25.500
Uh...

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.660
Right, that was ten!

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.580
Your movements were so light!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:38.950
That was amazing, Ayaka!

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.540
Nothing less from a boxer!

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:44.870
Don't say that, you guys did ten easily.

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:48.790
Akemi's a given, but you've
gotten stronger, too, Hibiki.

00:14:48.790 --> 00:14:50.750
Y-You think so?

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:53.200
Let's do something besides normal dips...

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.830
Oh! Why don't we try this, too?

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:57.620
"Aim for a higher level!!"

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.250
It's a weighted version.

00:15:00.250 --> 00:15:01.830
"Put on and do dips."

00:15:01.870 --> 00:15:05.290
I see, so there's another way to do it!

00:15:05.290 --> 00:15:07.870
Toshio Ozu, what a guy!

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:10.000
I got a backpack!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:15.790
All right! Then I'm going first!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.160
Okay, here I go!

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.450
One...

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:27.830
When doing dips, make sure your
chairs are strong enough to handle them.

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:30.120
I'm sorry! I broke your chairs!

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.370
I'll pay you back with my work money!

00:15:32.370 --> 00:15:34.000
Don't worry about it.

00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:35.370
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.290
"--Several Days Later--"

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:42.910
Goodness, what an absolute treasure!

00:15:42.910 --> 00:15:45.870
"Antique Appraisal Show"
A steal at its current price of
hundreds of millions of yen!

00:15:45.870 --> 00:15:48.410
"Antique Appraisal Show"
Very few of these exist!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.500
Wh-Wh-What...?

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:53.160
That chair looks sorta familiar...

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.120
Wh-What...?

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.790
Ah! I can see it now!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.660
The ocean!

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:09.330
Sensei! We can see the ocean!

00:16:09.330 --> 00:16:12.080
Uh-huh, that's great!

00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:16.870
I finally take my summer vacation,
and I end up running into them again...

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:21.410
I go all the way to the next prefecture's
beach in search of a romantic encounter...

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:23.000
--These are pretty good!
--...but I haven't seen anyone else so far.

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.750
--Yay, I'll have some!
--...but I haven't seen anyone else so far.

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:25.870
--Me, too!
--...but I haven't seen anyone else so far.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.450
--Sure!
--So be it.

00:16:27.450 --> 00:16:30.540
I'm sure we'll go our
separate ways at the beach.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:33.000
Hm? What's eating you, Akemi?

00:16:33.000 --> 00:16:36.290
Well, I've been wondering for a while now...

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:42.000
This is the height of the swimming season,
so why are we the only people on the bus?

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.000
Oh, didn't you see the news?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:05.790
They spotted a school of sharks offshore,
so summer swimming season is over.

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:07.790
"Hammerhead Sharks"

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:16.580
God freaking damn it.

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:19.790
And I came all the way here to get hit on...

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:21.620
What kind of plan is that?

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.620
I won't admit that was my plan, too...

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:28.910
The ocean's beautiful, the waves are calm...

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:31.330
What's the point if you can't go swimming?

00:17:36.620 --> 00:17:37.870
Oh, my, no!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.290
What a shame.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.750
Swimming is such good exercise...

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:51.500
Ah, of course that's why you came...

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:53.290
Oh! I know!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:58.830
If we can't use the ocean,
then let's use the beach!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:05.040
"~Training on the Beach~"
You've come all the way to the ocean,
but swimming's not allowed!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:10.330
"~Training on the Beach~"
Don't let that get you down!
I'll show you an effective beach exercise!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.250
"~Training on the Beach~"
That's still disappointing.

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:14.000
This is called a burpee.

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.080
"Burpee"
This is called a burpee.

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:19.250
"Burpee"
"Basic posture:
stand straight and natural"
It trains every muscle in your body.

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:25.450
"Burpee"
This aerobic exercise is effective at
burning fat and improving your cardio.

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:28.540
First, crouch in place with
both hands on the ground.

00:18:28.540 --> 00:18:33.000
Stretch your legs backward
and assume push-up posture.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.160
You can also do a push-up at this point.

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:40.410
Quickly return to a crouch,
then resume your original position.

00:18:40.410 --> 00:18:42.950
It's more effective if you jump here.

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:48.330
Repeat these movements as fast as you can.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:54.700
It's quite intense, but aim for 3 sets
of however many you can do.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:58.450
Warning: Burpees require lots of movement.

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:03.330
Don't forget to check your
surroundings when doing them inside.

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:06.540
Burpees will work out your whole body!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.750
Let's work toward a high level
of macho-ness together!

00:19:25.330 --> 00:19:27.540
Burpees really are the best!

00:19:27.540 --> 00:19:31.750
They're super effective when done
on unstable ground, like sand!

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:33.370
Th-This is brutal!

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:43.040
I'm... so tired!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.950
But that wasn't as bad as I expected!

00:19:48.950 --> 00:19:51.120
Oh, you're a tough one!

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:56.580
It really is great to train in
a different environment for a change!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:57.580
All right!

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.160
Who wants to do sprints next?

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:01.450
Me!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:08.120
Did they come from the city
to do strength training?

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.660
That's hardcore.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:16.700
The only tourists of the season secretly
garnered the attention of the locals.

00:20:18.290 --> 00:20:21.750
And so their summer came to an end.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.500
Ah, my body weighs a ton...

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:32.120
Oh, you've got a tan!

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:35.370
I went a bit overboard with
strength training on the beach.

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:37.200
Why on the beach?

00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:38.870
Second semester starts today.

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:41.200
I wonder if those girls are okay.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:43.250
I hope they aren't tired...

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:44.910
The beach was so much fun!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:46.910
--Right?
--Let's go again!

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:50.040
They're right as rain.

00:20:50.040 --> 00:20:52.250
That's the power of youth.

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:24.040
Today, we'll review the reverse push-up!

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:27.080
"20 Reverse Push-Ups"
Today, we'll review the reverse push-up!

00:22:27.370 --> 00:22:30.330
Do you have a chair or sofa
that can be fixed in place?

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:35.580
Spread your hands shoulder-width apart,
then lower yourself down as if sitting.

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:38.410
"Avoid using your legs"
Use your legs little as possible by
relying on the strength of your arms!

00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:40.330
"Avoid using your legs"
"Support yourself with your arms"
Use your legs little as possible by
relying on the strength of your arms!

00:22:40.450 --> 00:22:42.870
If you don't have a chair, use your bed!

00:22:42.870 --> 00:22:45.790
Now we'll lower ourselves
with the strength of our arms.

00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:47.750
Your goal is 20 reps!

00:22:47.750 --> 00:22:49.620
Eyes straight ahead!

00:22:49.620 --> 00:22:51.370
All set?

00:22:51.370 --> 00:22:53.410
Then get ready...

00:22:53.410 --> 00:22:54.410
Go!

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:04.700
Make sure you don't hold your breath!

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:10.620
Your deltoids and triceps are happy!

00:23:12.080 --> 00:23:13.500
This is hard!

00:23:14.250 --> 00:23:16.580
Don't rely on momentum!

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:20.410
Your chest is happy, too!

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:27.000
It's especially hard if you do it slowly!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.120
Here's where you need to hold out!

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.040
It's okay to take a breather.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.790
Just finish the set!

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:36.040
Last one!

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:37.370
Right, okay!

00:23:37.370 --> 00:23:38.750
Great job!

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:41.290
Wonderful! You worked so hard!

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:45.200
Keep these up, and the ideal
upper body is yours!

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:46.700
And as always...

00:23:46.700 --> 00:23:48.370
Nice bulk!
